# Copy to .env, or run `pnpm env:setup` to render it from 1Password.
# The console calls /v1 and /v2 same-origin: `pnpm dev` proxies them (and the
# /voischat WebSocket) to the LAN backend, `pnpm dev:prod` and the deployed
# Worker proxy them to https://api.voischat.cn. The SDK defaults its WebSocket
# to the same-origin /voischat/bridge in dev and to
# wss://api.voischat.cn/voischat/bridge elsewhere, so VITE_WEB_SOCK is only an
# override for pointing the SDK at another WebSocket origin.
# VITE_WEB_SOCK=wss://example.com/voischat/bridge
